17745021469" as="script"/><title>API Overview | PredictionData.io Documentation</title><meta name="description" content="Explore the PredictionData Markets API documentation. Learn about endpoints, data delivery modes, authentication, rate limits, and integration patterns for real-time sportsbook and prediction market data."/><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" crossorigin="use-credentials"/><meta name="keywords" content="predictiondata,predictiondata api,predictiondata docs,predictiondata documentation,predictiondata developer portal,predictiondata data feed,predictiondata integration,predictiondata sports data,predictiondata endpoints,predictiondata support,api docs,api documentation,sports prediction data,sports prediction api,sports market data feed,sports probabilities api,sports odds data api,sports event data,sports pricing data,real time sports market data,live sports prediction data,historical sports prediction data,api documentation tools,api documentation best practices,api reference,api endpoints guide,rest api documentation,api authentication,api keys and tokens,webhooks guide,pagination guide,api error codes,sample requests,sample responses,curl api example,python api example,javascript api example,node api example,php api example,sdk integration,developer onboarding,quickstart guide,rate limits info,sdk documentation,api endpoint documentation,odds data feed,implied probability data,market depth data,price movement feed,line movement data,event settlement data,trading signals data,sports contracts data,real time pricing feed,trend analysis data,exchange style pricing,event based markets,developer portal,prediction market api,data export,analytics integration,backtesting data,quant modeling sports,algorithmic forecasting,data visualization input,prediction modeling,portfolio modeling,hedging insights,risk modeling data,prop market data,team market data,player market data,league market data,polymarket data,polymarket api,polymarket market data